---
---
<section class="section-relaunch-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="relaunch-hero-grid">
      
      <div class="relaunch-hero-text">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Website relaunch
        </span>
        <h1 class="relaunch-hero-title">
          Regândim website-ul dumneavoastră fără a renunța inutil la ceea ce funcționează deja.
        </h1>
        <p class="relaunch-hero-lead">
          Website-ul nu mai corespunde companiei, pare depășit tehnic sau vizual, sau nu mai susține obiectivele actuale? Analizăm ce există și stabilim ce poate fi păstrat, ce trebuie îmbunătățit și ce trebuie reconstruit.
        </p>
        <p class="relaunch-hero-body">
          Gabriel Pop conduce personal relansarea și rămâne principala persoană de contact, de la evaluarea inițială până la publicare și predare.
        </p>
        
        <div class="relaunch-hero-ctas">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn-relaunch-primary">Discutați relansarea website-ului</a>
          <a href="#etape" class="btn-relaunch-secondary">Vedeți etapele</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relaunch-hero-visual">
        <div class="url-input-container">
          <div class="browser-top">
            <span class="browser-dot dot-red"></span>
            <span class="browser-dot dot-yellow"></span>
            <span class="browser-dot dot-green"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="url-bar">
            <svg class="lock-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
            </svg>
            <span class="url-text">https://domeniul-dumneavoastra.ro</span>
          </div>
          <div class="analysis-lines">
            <div class="a-line line-1"></div>
            <div class="a-line line-2"></div>
            <div class="a-line line-3"></div>
            <div class="a-line line-4"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="analysis-status">
            <div class="status-badge badge-keep">Se păstrează</div>
            <div class="status-badge badge-improve">Se îmbunătățește</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-relaunch-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 5rem);
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    background: var(--bg-page);
  }
  
  .relaunch-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .relaunch-hero-text {
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .relaunch-hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .relaunch-hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .relaunch-hero-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .relaunch-hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-relaunch-primary {
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(26, 47, 84, 0.15);
  }
  .btn-relaunch-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26, 47, 84, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-relaunch-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-light);
  }
  .btn-relaunch-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .relaunch-hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .url-input-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .browser-top {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .browser-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .dot-red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .dot-yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .dot-green { background: #27c93f; }

  .url-bar {
    background: var(--bg-page);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .lock-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .url-text {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .analysis-lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .a-line {
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .line-1 { width: 100%; background: var(--border-light); }
  .line-2 { width: 80%; }
  .line-3 { width: 90%; }
  .line-4 { width: 60%; }

  .analysis-status {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .status-badge {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .badge-keep {
    background: #ecfdf5;
    color: #059669;
    border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
  }
  .badge-improve {
    background: #eff6ff;
    color: #2563eb;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .relaunch-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .relaunch-hero-text { margin: 0 auto; }
    .relaunch-hero-ctas { justify-content: center; }
    .url-input-container { margin: 0 auto; }
  }
</style>
